ZfcIdealDualFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6DualFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{DualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\land F=\\{A\\subseteq X:X\\setminus A\\in I\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{DualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\land F=\\{A\\subseteq X:X\\setminus A\\in I\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealDualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealDualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6DualFilter}_S(X,I,F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6DualFilter}_S(X,I,F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-ideal-dual-filter</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-ideal6-dual-filter</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (ideal predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,I,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DualFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcIdealDualFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6DualFilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{DualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\land F=\\{A\\subseteq X:X\\setminus A\\in I\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdealDualFilter}_S(F,I,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DualFilter}_S(F,I,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}dual\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6DualFilter}_S(X,I,F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{DualFilter}_S(F,I,X)","display":true}],"bytes":1202,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1861","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-dual-filter.md|58-df-zfc-dual-filter]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6e4f95381faac4f9"]}